  "canon:title": "Convulsion following intravenous fluorescein angiography.",
  "canon:abstract": "Tonic-clonic seizures followed intravenous fluorescein injection for fundus angiography in a 47-year-old male. Despite precautions this adverse reaction recurred on re-exposure to intravenous fluorescein.",
